#. module: obox_quality_control
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_obox_quality_control
msgid ""
"\n"
"Use devices connected to an Obox to control the quality of your products.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"ນຳໃຊ້ອຸປະກອນທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ Obox ເພື່ອຄວບຄຸມຄຸນນະພາບຜະລິດຕະພັນຂອງທ່ານ.\n"

#. module: obox_quality_control
#: model:ir.module.module,summary:base.module_obox_quality_control
msgid "Control the quality of your products with Obox devices"
msgstr "ຄວບຄຸມຄຸນນະພາບຜະລິດຕະພັນຂອງທ່ານດ້ວຍອຸປະກອນ Obox"

